  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agriculture Transformation in Ghana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To accelerate economic transformation in Ghana through developing markets for agriculture and trade, improving resilience to climate change, and creating additional jobs and increased incomes by focusing on the development of high potential value chains in pro-poor sectors, supporting them to become productive, competitive and attractive for investment.</narrative>
  </description>
